{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0654_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0654_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "5f9839773d2ebdd0cd2dbb5d18bd4e8ac2b9e0c956c4a163e6c843cdcefeff25", "ja": "ま、またそういう……！　{$P$}……\n適当なこと言ってないですよね？", "zh": "又、又说这种话……！{$P$}……您不是在随便说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
